From: FontMod <fontmod@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 18:30:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fonts: add isolated custom font storage and live process
 refresh

Base: 044b965aa2d30d056b930e5ff013ba5303cde9fa
